* **`parA`**: from the axis descriptor `[k, pre, post, s, t, p, α, d]` on `dA = 31`, the
  registers `1 … 12` become `pre, post, s, t, p, α, m = sWidth p α, H = 2^⌊log₂ m⌋,
  W = H + m + 3, M = t / 16H, win = 8H, f = ⌊log₂ m⌋ + 3` (**`Rn.parA`**).
